msgid "Methodology and best practice"
msgstr "方法论与最佳实践"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this section, we are covering important methods and best practices that "
"will make your documentation better."
msgstr "本节介绍能让你的文档变得更好的重要方法和最佳实践。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:11
msgid "`Write the Docs: Topic Archive <https://www.writethedocs.org/topics/>`__"
msgstr "`Write the Docs: Topic Archive <https://www.writethedocs.org/topics/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:12
msgid ""
"A collection of conference talks and articles, indexed by topic (eg. "
"``Metrics and analytics`` or ``Information architecture``)"
msgstr "按主题索引的会议演讲和文章合集（例如 ``Metrics and analytics`` 或 ``Information architecture`` ）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:15
msgid ""
"You can familiarize yourself with these topics before or after writing "
"documentation. We encourage that you read this at any time, as this content "
"is applicable to many stages of the documentation process."
msgstr "你可以在编写文档之前或之后熟悉这些主题。我们鼓励你在任何时候阅读，因为这些内容适用于文档流程的许多阶段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:19
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`The Diátaxis Methodology <documentation-structure>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`Diátaxis 方法论 <documentation-structure>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:20
msgid ""
"We introduce the Diátaxis methodology which is also used for the "
"documentation you are now reading."
msgstr "我们介绍 Diátaxis 方法论，你现在阅读的文档也采用了该方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:22
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Creating reproducible builds </guides/reproducible-builds>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`创建可复现构建 </guides/reproducible-builds>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:23
msgid ""
"Every documentation project has dependencies that are required to build it. "
"Using an unspecified versions of these dependencies means that your project "
"can start breaking. In this guide, learn how to protect your project against"
" breaking randomly. **This is one of our most popular guides!**"
msgstr "每个文档项目都有构建所需的依赖。依赖版本不固定意味着项目可能随时出问题。本指南讲解如何防止项目意外失效。**这是我们最受欢迎的指南之一！**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:29
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Search engine optimization (SEO) for documentation projects "
"</guides/technical-docs-seo-guide>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`文档项目的搜索引擎优化（SEO） </guides/technical-docs-seo-guide>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/methodology.rst:30
msgid ""
"This article explains how documentation can be optimized to appear in search"
" results, increasing traffic to your docs."
msgstr "本文讲解如何优化文档以出现在搜索结果中，为你的文档带来更多流量。"

